Package: spbalance
Type: Package
Title: Covariate Balancing Propensity Scores with Spatial Confounding
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Nathan B.", "Wikle", email = "nbwikle@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates propensity scores with a loss that prioritises covariate
    balance, using spline and kernel ridge regression terms in space to adjust
    for unmeasured spatial confounding. Average treatment effects are estimated
    by inverse probability of treatment weighting (Horvitz-Thompson, Hajek and
    augmented estimators), with iid, spatial HAC or spatial block bootstrap
    standard errors.
